@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 230
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam noteBorderColor #C9A227
actor "1M fans" as F
participant "CDN" as CDN
participant "Waiting room\n+ Redis" as WR
participant "Admission\ncontroller" as AC
participant "Inventory\n+ PostgreSQL" as I
participant "PSP" as P
== T-30 min to T0 ==
F -> WR : joins spread over 30 min (~600/s)
note over CDN : page + countdown are static, served at the edge
== T0 ==
WR -> WR : phase = QUEUE, draw final
F -> WR : GET /queue/me, jittered over 20 s\n(~50,000/s, one Redis ZRANK each)
F -> CDN : polls start: ~100,000 req/s
CDN -> WR : ~200 req/s (1 per edge per s)
AC -> WR : slow start: R = 500/min,\nthen ramp towards 2,000/min
== T0 + 1 min ==
F -> I : first ~2,000 admitted fans: map + holds\n(~50 holds/s, a few 409s)
I -> P : first orders: ~25 authorizations/s
note over AC : signals healthy -> keep ramping.\nHold p99 over 300 ms -> cut R by 30%
== T0 + 15 min ==
AC -> WR : seats left / 2.5 < fans still shopping\n-> soldOut = true
WR -> CDN : next 1-second refresh carries soldOut
CDN -> F : 970,000 fans see "sold out" within ~10 s
@enduml
